{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-04_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-04","title":"苦厄盘桓","storyCode":"13-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"08b24793f01991d39c4681101360b91a613dfc33235f27bac3a05f0b75d902bd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"救下了博士和阿米娅的Logos一行也遇到了幻境，Logos看到了女妖的河谷，想起了自己成为女妖之主时对母亲的誓言。他们遇上了明椒率领的后勤小队，并征用了该小队的车。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雾气越来越浓了，整片森林几乎都浸泡其中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"其实，我并不熟悉卡兹戴尔，女妖的王庭在两百年前的战争之后，就已经离开了那座城市。我在女妖的河谷长大。\n我曾经问过母亲，为什么她作为“六英雄”之一，却选择离开那座她曾为之奋战到底的卡兹戴尔。\n当时母亲没有回答，她从河边捡起了几条芦苇，为我编了一条项链，那些草茎相互缠绕，首尾相连。\n很漂亮，我将它视作珍宝，但是很快，它就干枯变色，成了些松散的碎片。\n母亲告诉我，那是女妖最传统的技艺，我们编织歌声与咒文，就如同编织青草的项链。\n可是，我们现在拥有了整个河谷。\n它们不用被采撷，不用被缠绕，所以它们年复一年，永远生长。\n女妖唱响挽歌，但挽歌不是终结的哀告，而是新生的期许。\n萨卡兹们需要的，不是守住一座待死的城，而是，生长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的环境让人很不安，博士，我们之前还在一片密林中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随着雾气渐浓，我们眼前的景色已然迥异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一片......河谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些东西都是幻觉吗，Logos？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士负伤不轻，但语调已经恢复了沉稳。\n阿斯卡纶沉默地抱着还未醒来的阿米娅，走在前列。\n她和以往一样，一言不发。但我能察觉到，她如今的沉默，比以往......更加暗淡。\n我还记得她与我匆忙会合的时候，那一闪而过的，我难以分辨的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻象自虚无中来，它们只是人脑中虚构的景色，就算再逼真也只会被归为虚假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的所有东西，都曾经真实地存在过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"构筑这样一个，“幻境”，不仅需要情报与信息，甚至需要，时间与空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太困难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨哨声？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我熟悉这片河谷。\n我一直爱着这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女妖们的骨哨。未必有源石技艺的意味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还小的时候，会在河边练习骨哨，我们会坐在草丛中，静静等待。直到小虫被大鳞吞下，直到大鳞被羽兽捉起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骨哨声就会在此时鸣响。"},{"type":"narration","text":"这里为什么会有这样的景色？我们怎么才能离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种并非源石技艺的力量，只可能与更加古老的力量有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它不该出现在这片战场上，出现在伦蒂尼姆的周边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的声音和场景都很难分辨真假，我们这支队伍的状态不好，必须提高警惕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"河谷的那边，似乎有个人正在默默伫立。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......母亲。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尝试直接撕裂这片景色吧，这有些风险，但却是最好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道离开这里是否安全，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶点了点头，把阿米娅交给了博士，博士勉强用没受伤的那只手扶住了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶，这位刺客大师转眼间就消失进雾霭之中。\n我闭目准备，构思着破坏，想象着重建。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但那个人影又出现了，这次在河谷边的小山上，她好像在看着我，也好像只是过去的切片，停滞在了往昔里的某个时间。\n那座小山我很熟悉，小的时候，我总是在那里练习咒术，等到暮色渐起，她就会出现在我的身后。\n我从来不知道她到底是什么时候来的，她只是站在那里，如同这里的幻象一样。\n等到我精疲力尽，我们就会一起回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我摸出了自己的骨哨，冰凉冷冽，如同我第一次得到它的时候一样。\n在不久前，我为变形者王庭的消散吹响了它。\n而它再上一次响起，就是在这片河谷之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明天就会出发，前往巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经是女妖王庭的主人，记得向特蕾西娅殿下带去我的问候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还是没有什么实感，母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为王庭之主，我过于年轻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，怎么会呢，你的杰出有目共睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的骨哨，我为它调了律，加上了王庭的徽记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，还有一个充满魔力的吻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要骨哨声响起，所有萨卡兹都会知道，这是丧钟的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母亲，女妖之主应该做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做你认为必须做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾和您谈起过我的那些......疯话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被束缚的萨卡兹没有出路，就如同您曾经送给我的编织项链，结果只有破碎一途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而束缚我们的，正是我们的身份，我们的所属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“王庭”，也许还有，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可您还是把这个身份交给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灭亡的终点一旦抵达，腐朽的躯骸就永不可能再度苏生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......这就是规律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为一切鸣响丧钟，为他人，也为自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是要肩负责任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你觉得我们古老的传承早已成为新生的垫脚石，你就应该去亲自确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你没有改变你的看法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“新生从灭亡中来”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我把骨哨送到了嘴边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的新的女妖之主啊，您第一首稚嫩的丧钟为谁而鸣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......为我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为所有过去和未来将要腐朽的王庭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹必须书写新的词句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“停滞的景观有何意义？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"力量随言语迸发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g8_wildernesswarcircle"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔的巫术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但血魔无法营造出刚才的景观，恐怕还有别的存在在帮助他。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔想用这些法阵做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士吃力地扶着阿米娅，有些担忧地仰头看着巨大的血色结晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的回路并不完整，但是......有几个可被阅读的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“纯化”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它想对我们的血脉产生影响。对萨卡兹的血脉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种术式......与萨卡兹的力量有关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士并没有回应，好像在思考着什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呵，他们终于按耐不住了。\n我已经察觉这些人很久了，几个粗陋的游荡者。那些错乱的时空遮蔽了他们的身姿，如今，雾气已散去，他们终于现身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶手中的银光已经袭上他们的颈间，自骨笔泻出的咒文挡下了他们的攻击。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一枚土块？简直像孩子般粗率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说，他们是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些鬼魂是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啊，还真是个孩子。\n你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士和眼前的这个萨卡兹女孩认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那个，“博士”？我在海布里区的军工厂看见过你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个昏迷的卡特斯，和......萨卡兹？"},{"type":"narration","text":"在诺伯特区，你为难民们提供了物资。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别、别乱说！我只是，呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位卡特斯小姐的状态好像不太好？你的胳膊也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，呃，你们跟萨卡兹在一起，应该......没什么问题吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们好像回到原来的地方了，但这次是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再看见顶着光环的怪兽了，根本没道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你怎么在跟那些鬼魂说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"一个......戴着兜帽的人，一只昏迷的兔子，还有个萨卡兹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是！司机小姐，他们是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这个萨卡兹走到我的面前，狐疑地上下打量着我。\n我一眼就能看出来，她根本没上过战场，她手上老茧的位置不对。\n刚才那个叫明椒的小姑娘，喊她司机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿工，你也来瞧瞧，果然是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你这身衣服，挺值钱对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再仔细看看！算了，你这种乌萨斯来的乡巴佬怎么会懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老财，别每次把自己说得像是什么卡兹戴尔的大人物，你不过是在那有家杂货店而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我忘了，你还把你的店卖了，就为了来这里找架打，哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放尊重点！别在他面前造次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，哈哈......您也许在卡兹戴尔见过我，我的杂货店还算有点名气......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这个外号老财的男人搓着手，谄媚地看着我。\n他的刀上还带着辅助控制源石技艺的仪器，这东西应该价格不菲。可惜，包括刀本身，都是全新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......王庭的成员，对吧？我认得您这身衣服......您是，土石之子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n看来这家伙并不了解什么王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男性女妖？女妖不基本都是女性吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，我在卡西米尔可从来没听说过男女妖......呃，我是不是太失礼了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你居然认识这种大人物？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不、不算认识吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在运货？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看见他们的货车中，没被布盖着的地方，几块流着血纹的结晶暴露出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要把这些物资运去哪里？这些好像是仪式的材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我不知道该怎么说，我们只是跟着路线图巡查，有些法阵会有点损坏，我们就要修好它们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士看了我一眼，我有所了悟，萨卡兹货车，能带我们穿越战场的载具。\n按照阿米娅现在的状态，我们不可能步行去与大部队会合。\n我能感觉到，阴影中的阿斯卡纶已经做好了准备，随时可以攻击眼前这支外行的小队。\n但显然，博士已经有了更好的办法。\n尊贵的女妖大人，我们这样不可能活着穿越战场，求求你干脆让我们解脱吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我马上理解了博士的想法，但......我真的很不熟悉做这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的运输队被我征用了。我们正在执行极其特殊的任务，却在路上遇到了袭击，你们的协助将会被我铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，能够为王庭成员服务是我们的荣幸，阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......被报丧女妖铭记......总觉得不太吉利。能不能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是报酬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"得感谢Mechanist在我口袋里塞的硬币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，感谢老爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们的运输任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事后我会向你的上级说明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊任务？为什么会带着这两个异族人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们是我的俘虏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俘虏？可是，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......但结束之后，你们要和我一起去见曼弗雷德将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先去整理几个位置出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士走到了我的身边，语气很严肃。\nLogos，想办法分一辆车给阿斯卡纶。\n赦罪师的袭击并不单纯，他们与血魔一起行动，但却把阿米娅带离了那条船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你在担心？"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希尔和自救军的队伍中没有合适的战斗人员，凯尔希受了伤，闪灵很强大，但赦罪师一定为她单独准备了手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅的状态恐怕不是药物所能治愈的，她现在更需要的，是在醒来之前，不再落入赦罪师们的视线之中。\n借助这支小队行动，反而会更安全。\n我会让阿斯卡纶支援凯尔希，这里有你在。\n况且......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士忧心忡忡地看着血色的法阵。\n不必说，我更了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些结晶......不是简单的源石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
